      "title": "What goes in and out",
      "items": [
        "QR approval rotates the cookie; D1 stores a keyed fingerprint",
        "Private Discord commands verify a separate bot DM before activation",
        "Allowlist excludes Riot purchases, equipping and chat"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Session custody",
      "items": [
        "Session, cache, QR, stop links and outbox use distinct encryption purposes",
        "D1 decides revocation, OTP attempts and Discord opt-in",
        "Rotating JAR_KEY invalidates old credentials and ciphertext"
      ]
